{"ticker":"MAS","updated":"2026-10-30T22:58:11Z","profile":{"longName":"Masco Corporation","shortName":"Masco Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"United States","website":"https://masco.com","fullTimeEmployees":18000,"marketCap":15544900608,"trailingPE":17.492407,"forwardPE":17.3375,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0272431,"pegRatio":1.84,"targetMeanPrice":82.42105,"targetHighPrice":98.0,"targetLowPrice":70.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.026,"earningsGrowth":0.3,"grossMargins":0.36606997,"operatingMargins":0.17243,"profitMargins":0.12076,"totalRevenue":7667999744,"beta":1.291,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":83.64,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":58.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.6},"summary":"Masco Corporation provides home improvement and building products in North America, Europe, and internationally. The company's Plumbing Products segment offers faucets, showerheads, handheld showers, valves, bath hardware and accessories, bathing units, shower bases and enclosures, shower drains, steam shower systems, water filtration systems, and sinks and kitchen accessories; acrylic tubs, bath and shower enclosures, and shower bases and trays; spas, exercise pools, and aquatic fitness systems and saunas; brass, copper, and composite plumbing system component and other non-decorative plumbing products; water products; and thermoplastic products, extruded plastic profiles, and specialized fabrication products, as well as PEX tubing products. This segment provides its products under the DELTA, BRIZO, PEERLESS, HANSGROHE, AXOR, KRAUS, NEWPORT BRASS, GINGER, WALTEC, BRISTAN, HERITAGE, MIROLIN, HOT SPRING, CALDERA, FREEFLOW SPAS, FANTASY SPAS, AQUATERRA, LIFESMART, ENDLESS POOLS, TYLO, FINNLEO, HELO, BRASSCRAFT, PLUMBSHOP, and MASTER PLUMBER brands, as well as under private label to home center and online retailers, mass merchandisers, wholesalers and distributors, plumbers, building contractors, remodelers, smaller retailers, and consumers and homebuilders. Its Decorative Architectural Products segment offers paints, primers, specialty coatings, stains, and waterproofing products","summary_zh":"Masco Corporation 在北美、歐洲和國際上提供家居裝修和建築產品。該公司的水暖產品部門提供水龍頭、淋浴頭、手持花灑、閥門、浴室五金和配件、沐浴裝置、淋浴底座和外殼、淋浴排水管、蒸汽淋浴系統、水過濾系統以及水槽和廚房配件；亞克力浴缸、浴缸和淋浴房、淋浴底座和托盤；水療中心、健身池、水上健身系統和水油型管道、浴缸和淋浴房、淋浴間底座和托盤；水療中心、健身池、水上健身系統和水暖型管道產品、非塑膠型管道產品以及非塑膠型管道；管材產品。該部門提供 DELTA、BRIZO、PEERLESS、HANSGROHE、AXOR、KRAUS、NEWPORT BRASS、GINGER、WALTEC、BRISTAN、HERITAGE、MIROLIN、HOT SPRING、CALDERA、FREEFLOW SpaS、FANTASYEOS、AQUATERRA、LIFE Spa, HELO、BRASSCRAFT、PLUMBSHOP 和 MASTER PLUMBER 品牌以及自有品牌面向家居中心和線上零售商、大宗商品商、批發商和分銷商、管道工、建築承包商、改造商、小型零售商以及消費者和住宅建築商。其裝飾建築產品部門提供油漆、底漆、特殊塗料、著色劑和防水產品","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"建築產品和設備","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":72.16,"h":72.61,"l":71.53,"c":72.38,"v":2277400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":72.11,"h":72.49,"l":71.65,"c":72.33,"v":1149100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":72.9,"h":74.01,"l":72.46,"c":73.98,"v":1760800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":75.09,"h":76.28,"l":74.93,"c":76.07,"v":2806500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":75.88,"h":76.1,"l":74.26,"c":75.8,"v":2319800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":75.17,"h":75.46,"l":73.0,"c":73.45,"v":3140500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":73.49,"h":73.91,"l":73.03,"c":73.17,"v":1975100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":73.47,"h":75.42,"l":73.17,"c":75.22,"v":1694800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":74.66,"h":75.03,"l":73.54,"c":73.63,"v":1639600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":74.12,"h":74.21,"l":73.07,"c":73.46,"v":1487400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":73.8,"h":74.07,"l":73.07,"c":73.3,"v":2082500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":73.71,"h":75.54,"l":71.78,"c":72.47,"v":2772000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":72.86,"h":73.29,"l":72.43,"c":72.99,"v":2902700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":73.09,"h":73.09,"l":72.03,"c":72.24,"v":4819600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":72.02,"h":72.5,"l":71.03,"c":71.03,"v":3003500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":71.24,"h":71.63,"l":70.72,"c":71.58,"v":3548700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":71.1,"h":71.97,"l":70.97,"c":71.58,"