co beats Q3 estimates, raises full-year guidance By Investing.com","src":"Investing.com Nigeria","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOT2RxQndzTHJxMEpFMi1MN3BNVFB5WlYwdnBaQWluTDNXeDF6dzdaX2FFSE5XSVo1c0dRTW5aVnpkZ0c3Z0ZwUTNmMEZPakJ1VlR2V1hrSHp0eEd2SV93dGNpaW5rNW1kcjdZMUpMekRZX0ZtV2ZzR29LSExncG9MdlZkVGhVeTRBNDJUMzExUEJ6SUZxTjdjQ3U3Ny1INmlfeEllTXdNbVgwcHB0NlFz?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Masco 超出第三季預期，上調全年指引 Investing.com"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":12},{"name":"分析師評等","count":5},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-10","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/62996/000006299626000005/mas-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Masco Corporation and its subsidiaries (the \"Company\") is a global leader in the design, manufacture and distribution of branded home improvement and building products. Our portfolio of industry-leading brands includes BEHR paint; DELTA and HANSGROHE faucets, bath and shower fixtures; LIBERTY branded decorative and functional hardware; and HOT SPRING spas. We leverage our powerful brands across product categories, sales channels and geographies to create value for our customers and shareholders.","zh":null},{"en":"We believe that our solid results of operations and financial position for 2025 resulted from our continued focus on our strategy to drive the full potential of our core businesses, leverage opportunities across our enterprise, and actively manage our portfolio.","zh":null},{"en":"In 2025, we continued to return value to our shareholders by repurchasing approximately 8.5 million shares of our common stock and increasing our quarterly dividend by approximately seven percent compared to 2024.","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"We report our financial results in two segments, our Plumbing Products segment and our Decorative Architectural Products segment, which are aggregated by product similarity. Our Decorative Architectural Products segment is impacted by seasonality and normally experiences stronger sales during the second and third calendar quarters, corresponding with the peak season for repair and remodel activity.","zh":null},{"en":"Our plumbing products include faucets, showerheads, handheld showers, valves, bath hardware and accessories, bathing units, shower bases and enclosures, shower drains, steam shower systems, water filtration systems, sinks and kitchen accessories. We primarily sell these products to home center retailers, online retailers, mass merchandisers, wholesalers and distributors that, in turn, sell them to plumbers, building contractors, remodelers, smaller retailers, consumers and homebuilders. The majority of our faucet, bathing and showering products are sold primarily in North America, Europe and China under the brand names DELTA , BRIZO , PEERLESS , HANSGROHE , AXOR , KRAUS , NEWPORT BRASS and WALTEC . Our BRISTAN and HERITAGE products are sold primarily in the United Kingdom.","zh":null}],"customers":[{"en":"Our Decorative Architectural Products segment primarily includes architectural coatings, including paints, primers, specialty coatings, stains and waterproofing products, as well as paint applicators and accessories. These products are sold primarily in North America as well as in South America under the brand names BEHR , KILZ , WHIZZ and other trademarks to \"do it yourself\" and professional customers through home center retailers and other retailers. Net sales of architectural coatings comprised approximately 31 percent of our consolidated net sales in 2025 and 32 percent of our consolidated net sales in 2024 and 2023. Our BEHR products are sold through The Home Depot, our largest customer overall, as well as this segment's largest customer. Our Behr business grants to The Home Depot Behr brand exclusivity in the retail sales channel in North America and exclusivity with respect to Kil","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Plumbing Products","val":4992000000,"zh":"Plumbing Products"},{"name":"Decorative Architectural Products","val":2570000000,"zh":"Decorative Architectural Products"}],"total":7562000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":5950000000,"zh":"North America"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1612000000,"zh":"Non Us"}],"total":7562000000}},"peers":["MHK","IFF","IR","MLM","RHI"]}}